* LM317T functional DC model for Qucs-S / ngspice
* Purpose: operating-point and DC-sweep verification of the gel charger task
* Physical TO-220 pin order and SUBCKT order:
*   Pin 1 = ADJ
*   Pin 2 = OUT
*   Pin 3 = IN
*
* Default VDROP=1.0 V is an optimistic functional value selected so the
* mandated 15 V input / 13.8 V output test can regulate.
* For a conservative headroom sensitivity check, instantiate with VDROP=2.0.
*
.SUBCKT LM317T ADJ OUT IN PARAMS: VREF=1.25 IADJ=50u VDROP=1.0 ROUT=0.03
BREG NREG ADJ V={MAX(0,MIN(VREF,V(IN,ADJ)-VDROP))}
ROUT_SER NREG OUT {ROUT}
IADJ_SRC IN ADJ DC {IADJ}
RLEAK OUT ADJ 100MEG
.ENDS LM317T
